# RAG Reasoning Engine

FastAPI retrieval-augmented generation demo using **local TF-IDF embeddings** — no API keys or external models.

## Architecture

```
data/sample_docs/*.txt
        │
        ▼
   chunker.py  ──► overlapping word chunks
        │
        ▼
 embeddings.py ──► sparse TF-IDF vectors
        │
        ▼
    index.py   ──► in-memory chunk store
        │
        ▼
  retriever.py ──► cosine top-k search
        │
        ▼
  reasoner.py  ──► cited answer synthesis
        │
        ▼
     api.py     ──► POST /query, GET /health
```

## Quick start

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
pytest -v
uvicorn rag.api:app --reload
```

Example query:

```bash
curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/query \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"question": "What is TF-IDF?", "top_k": 3}'
```

